.TH FILE_CLOSE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
file_close \- close a Crunch file descriptor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B long file_close(long descriptor);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Closes a descriptor such as one returned by file_open.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set. Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR file_open (3crunch),
.BR close (3crunch)
